WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.532 --> 00:00:03.960
- Catherine, two things,

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:06.150
bravo on whatever was going on in there.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.010
- It is not.

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:10.490
- It is whatever your heart
desires and none of my business.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:12.660
I will let the fates play their hand.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:16.580
Second, I think your best come
to the state room with me.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:20.173
The lunch seems to not sit
well in some people's stomachs.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:23.903
- What do they want?

00:00:23.903 --> 00:00:24.830
- I don't know.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:28.030
Anytime one of them talks,
the others start yelling.

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.420
I made them put that pistols in a bucket.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:31.890
- It's times like these I'm so glad

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.860
you're my key military strategist.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:36.763
- Tread light my dear, we
will be here if you need us.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.113
- Gentlemen.

00:00:42.113 --> 00:00:44.446
(men argue)

00:00:47.171 --> 00:00:49.293
Do you have a representative

00:00:49.293 --> 00:00:51.430
- Empress, empress, forgive the mob.

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.210
We are here to object to your plans

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:54.337
to free the (indistinct).

00:00:55.325 --> 00:00:57.270
- Well, there's been a
misunderstanding then.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:58.753
- Lying German bitch.

00:00:58.753 --> 00:01:00.820
(men argue)

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.710
- We have no concrete plans.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:05.190
Only an innocent jape that
I hope you all enjoyed.

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.530
- So you are telling
us you have not sought

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:07.440
any further than that.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:08.400
- Indeed.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:13.030
- You haven't written down
say 109 page master plan.

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:15.200
- Oddly specific, but no.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.514
- Would you mind
explaining these documents

00:01:17.514 --> 00:01:18.703
Ollo has given us?

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.253
- They forced it out to me at gunpoint.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:28.940
- You set me up.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:30.210
- Nothing personal.

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:33.037
Actually that's probably
a tiny bit untrue.

00:01:33.037 --> 00:01:34.283
- A moment, gentlemen.

00:01:35.902 --> 00:01:36.890
Are you all right?

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:37.940
You seem a little red.

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:39.313
- I feel a little red.

00:01:41.811 --> 00:01:43.660
Everyone wants to kick me right now.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:46.860
- Fonder that later, act on this now.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:50.440
You must explain that this is
another of your experiments,

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:53.760
barely sketched out and open to change.

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:57.130
Forgive them their panic for
it seems you wish to unpick

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:58.830
the basis of everything they know,

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:00.943
you don't.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:06.820
- If you could be quiet,
I would like to explain.

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:08.460
- If you expect them to work for us,

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:11.690
then someone's going to have
to pay them labor costs.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.690
The impact of which no one knows

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.440
other than to make our
exports uncompetitive.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.180
- The tax would crush us on core.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.650
- We would figure all that out.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:22.190
If we open our minds to it,

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:24.810
I know we have the
solution in this very room.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:27.113
- We will be at the whim of those inbreds.

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:32.520
- Who have rights, who are
human souls with much to give.

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:35.600
- Ah we run their lives, feed, house

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:36.970
instruct them, care for them.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:39.870
And you tend to want to do
all of that for themselves

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:41.680
and in their downtime

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:44.120
and contribute ideas of genius to Russia.

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:45.310
No offense,

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:48.633
but it don't sound like madness
when you're out of your own.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:52.570
- Gentlemen, these papers...

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:53.473
- These ones?

00:02:56.088 --> 00:02:58.421
(men cheer)

00:03:01.533 --> 00:03:03.890
- Give us your word this
will never happen Empress,

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:06.171
and we will of course go back to honoring

00:03:06.171 --> 00:03:08.352
and supporting you.

00:03:08.352 --> 00:03:09.462
(men argue)

00:03:09.462 --> 00:03:10.795
- Gentlemen.

00:03:10.795 --> 00:03:11.953
Gentlemen.

00:03:11.953 --> 00:03:14.286
(men argue)

00:03:17.101 --> 00:03:21.143
Gentlemen listen or I'll shoot you all.

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:28.570
I understand what you've read
this evening seems alarming.

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:35.493
And upon reflection
you are probably right.

00:03:37.803 --> 00:03:40.210
I have been a lying German bitch

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:46.850
because I will be freeing
the servants today.

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:49.510
And yes, I yelled that bit for effect

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:51.900
and yes you will pay them a wage

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.170
and they will buy goods and services

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.700
and create another economy.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:58.530
And they will strive for
more and invest themselves

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:01.130
in Russia and the filthy
stain of (indistinct)

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:02.360
will be off your hearts.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:05.160
And unfortunately you may
actually end up richer,

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.390
but I actually don't care
whether it costs you,

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.630
it will be done.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:11.310
And there's no amount of threat or spittle

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:14.150
that you can aim at me that
will change my mind on that.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.940
Get used to the future gentleman

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.233
because it's coming.

00:04:20.749 --> 00:04:22.125
Who threw that?

00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:22.958
(men arguing)

00:04:22.958 --> 00:04:25.430
Oh God why are they throwing shoes?

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:28.383
- They hate you and I took their guns.

00:04:28.383 --> 00:04:30.966
(men yelling)

